.Instrument Definitions

; VMPK's .ins parser only supports one Control= per instrument, not one per
; bank (Control[N]= errors as "Unknown .Instrument Definitions entry") -
; unlike Patch[N]=, which is bank-indexed. So both banks below share the
; same Control: dropdown, USBSID-Pico Midi Control - while playing Cynthcart
; patches (bank 1), several of the same CC numbers are reinterpreted
; differently by Cynthcart itself; see the [USBSID Cynthcart Control]
; section above for the actual meaning those CCs take on in that mode.
[USBSID-Pico]
Patch[0]=USBSID-Pico Patch
Patch[1]=USBSID-Pico FMOpl Patch
; Bank MSB 0 starts at 0
Patch[2]=Cynthcart Patch
; Bank MSB 1 starts at 128
Control=USBSID-Pico Midi Control
